1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,250
Listen to an announcement in a classroom.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:06,040
Woman: Please note that we will not be meeting on Friday.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:10,440
I just received a last-minute invitation to present at a conference this weekend

4
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,110
and I'll be flying on Friday.

5
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:15,170
I know that you were going to start your presentations then.

6
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,980
Julie and Max, we'll just move you to Monday

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,140
and those scheduled for Monday will move to Wednesday, and so on.

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:25,260
This will actually give everyone a few extra days to work on your presentations.
